// Count of kept winning labeled hammings strictly greater than lower central.
// An empty above-set returns -1, not 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hlhcn ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hlhcn rank

IMPULSE hlhcn 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hlhcn" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
